      "lines": [
        "$\\frac{\\Delta w(x)}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{w(x+\\Delta x)-w(x)}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{\\frac{u(x+\\Delta x)}{v(x+\\Delta x)}-\\frac{u(x)}{v(x)}}{\\Delta x}↵=\\frac{\\frac{u+\\Delta u}{v+\\Delta v}-\\frac{u}{v}}{\\Delta x}=\\frac{v\\Delta u-u\\Delta v}{\\Delta x\\cdot v(v+\\Delta v)}=\\frac{v\\frac{\\Delta u}{\\Delta x}-u\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta x}}{v(v+\\Delta v)}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据第45小节的引理，$\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\Delta v(x)=0$，因此"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\left(\\frac{u}{v}\\right)'=w'=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{\\Delta w}{\\Delta x}=\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{v\\frac{\\Delta u}{\\Delta x}-u\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta x}}{v(v+\\Delta v)}↵=\\frac{v\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{\\Delta u}{\\Delta x}-u\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}\\frac{\\Delta v}{\\Delta x}}{v\\lim_{\\Delta x\\to0}(v+\\Delta v)}=\\frac{vu'-uv'}{v\\cdot v}=\\frac{vu'-uv'}{v^2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$\\left(\\frac{2+3x}{1-2x}\\right)'=\\frac{(2+3x)'(1-2x)-(2+3x)(1-2x)'}{(1-2x)^2}↵=\\frac{3(1-2x)+2(2+3x)}{(1-2x)^2}=\\frac{7}{(1-2x)^2}$."
      ]
    },
